    "sha256": "2410e48a95aca632bad0b1f456044fa3b9cc8b122201e0306e57401148002b01",
    "bytes": 7386,
    "description": "Pass 8. Blend the skirt across the center line and close hips borders.\n\nStarts from pass 7. Thigh and shoulder weights stay unless a vertex is\nhips-dominant cloth next to the skirt."
  },
  {
    "path": "work\\fix_pass9.py",
